 an enclosure around text or symbols. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bracket enclosure is similar to a rectangle with the bottom line missing, as is common in jazz notation. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inverted-bracket enclosure is similar to a rectangle with the top line missing."}],"type":"topic"}}}